- The value of a semaphore: the **remaining quantity of this resource** (if the semaphore value is less than 0, it means some process is currently waiting for this resource);
- ⟦MC_ed34efc966742035_0⟧: request one resource S; if **the resource is insufficient, block and wait**;
- ⟦MC_9c77272ebbd5e73b_0⟧: release one resource S; if some process is waiting for this resource, **wake up one process**.
